<title>USA: SETECH Inc acquires Lewis Supply.</title>
<headline>SETECH Inc acquires Lewis Supply.</headline>
<dateline>MURFREESBORO, Tenn. 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>SETECH Inc completed the acquisition of Memphis-based Lewis Supply Co Inc for undisclosed terms.</p>
<p>SETECH's subsidiaries provide integrated supply, inventory management and engineering services to the manufacturing industry, including a major automobile manufacturer.</p>
<p>First Union Financial Corp provided a portion of the funds for the acquisition.</p>
